{"id":911,"date":"2023-01-16T13:10:28","date_gmt":"2023-01-16T03:40:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=911"},"modified":"2023-05-13T08:13:32","modified_gmt":"2023-05-12T22:43:32","slug":"product-keyword-research","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/","title":{"rendered":"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"911\" class=\"elementor elementor-911\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb0a5f0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bb0a5f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba896ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ba896ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Product Keyword Research is a vital part of any Google Pmax or Bing shopping campaign. Do you want to reach more customers and sell more products? Selecting the right keywords and making sure that they appear in your product data feed is your answer.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfdce1a elementor-toc--minimized-on-tablet elementor-widget elementor-widget-table-of-contents\" data-id=\"cfdce1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;headings_by_tags&quot;:[&quot;h2&quot;,&quot;h3&quot;],&quot;exclude_headings_by_selector&quot;:[],&quot;marker_view&quot;:&quot;numbers&quot;,&quot;no_headings_message&quot;:&quot;No headings were found on this page.&quot;,&quot;minimize_box&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;minimized_on&quot;:&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;hierarchical_view&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;min_height&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_laptop&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;min_height_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"table-of-contents.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-toc__header-title\">\n\t\t\t\tTable of Contents\t\t\t<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--expand\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__cfdce1a\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__toggle-button elementor-toc__toggle-button--collapse\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"elementor-toc__cfdce1a\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"Close table of contents\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-chevron-up\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"elementor-toc__cfdce1a\" class=\"elementor-toc__body\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-toc__spinner-container\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"elementor-toc__spinner eicon-animation-spin e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M500 975V858C696 858 858 696 858 500S696 142 500 142 142 304 142 500H25C25 237 238 25 500 25S975 237 975 500 763 975 500 975Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3bedb41 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3bedb41\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0f6e38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"e0f6e38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ee1284 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ee1284\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why product keyword research matters!<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d4db13 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d4db13\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Product Keyword research is a vital aspect of ecommerce success, as it allows businesses to identify the most popular search terms related to their product. By understanding which keywords are being used most often by potential customers, ecommerce advertisers can strategically place them in titles, product descriptions and other product attributes to ensure they appear at the top of search engine results.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-747b116 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"747b116\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-284abd3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"284abd3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Shoppers use keywords to search for products<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-644b799 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"644b799\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Shopping online is a popular and convenient way for consumers to find the products they need. As such, it\u2019s important to understand how shoppers search online in order to best meet their needs. Generally speaking, shoppers typically start by searching for specific items or brands they are interested in buying.&nbsp; Additionally, many shoppers will use search terms that include colors and sizes to narrow down their choices before making a purchase.<br><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4e7a7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f4e7a7b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Google, Microsoft &amp; Meta need product data to train ML&lt;\/<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c88c776 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c88c776\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Google, Microsoft, and Meta use\u00a0 product data signals to train their machine learning algorithms. Product data with keywords provides a real-world context for the machine learning model to interact with, helping it to develop deeper understanding of how various attributes of a product relate to shoppers searching for products to buy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98b7100 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"98b7100\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Keywords in product data also make better ads<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75c96b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"75c96b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Keywords in your product feeds can help you make better ads. This is because the media use the data from your products to create the ads and decide who should see them. For example, if you have a keyword for a certain type of shoe, then people who search for that type of shoe will be more likely to see your ad when it comes up.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e3ced5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0e3ced5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28eed61 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"28eed61\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to conduct Product Keyword Research?<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35e48dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"35e48dc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>There are many free product keyword research tools, a quick Google search will uncover a few, however, the\u00a0Google Keyword Planner\u00a0is a great place to start.<\/p><p>You can also use the\u00a0<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Free\u00a0FeedOps Product Keyword Research Tool<\/span>\u00a0which is available when you\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/app.feedops.com\/sign_up\">sign up<\/a>\u00a0and create a free account.<\/p><p>The main benefit of the FeedOps to find keywords is that you can also add them to your shopping feeds.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1f858acd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1f858acd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7ee89153\" data-id=\"7ee89153\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c04f0a1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c04f0a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Fetching Keyword Ideas feature in FeedOps<\/h2><p>Users can now select the highest volume keywords for their product types. Having this best practice in place means greater visibility for your products and<a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/blogs\/new-feature-feedops-playbook-items\/\"> product categories<\/a> across a higher volume of relevant keyword searches.<\/p><p>Remember, the product feed data is essentially the only data that search engines use to match your products to buyers.\u00a0 Having rich layers of optimised data makes a big difference to the overall success of the campaigns.<\/p><h3>Working Example of fetching Keyword Ideas<\/h3><p>As an example, Google strongly recommends at least 3 layers of product types.\u00a0<\/p><p>In this example, we see that this website has only 2 levels of product depth in their feed. As highlighted in the red box, Product Type category levels 3 to 5 are \u2018empty\u2019 and so is the \u2018Focus Keyword\u2019 column.<\/p><p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/FeedOps-Product-Feed-Editor-Edit-Product-Types.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1166px) 100vw, 1166px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/FeedOps-Product-Feed-Editor-Edit-Product-Types.png 1166w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/FeedOps-Product-Feed-Editor-Edit-Product-Types-300x174.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/FeedOps-Product-Feed-Editor-Edit-Product-Types-1024x595.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/FeedOps-Product-Feed-Editor-Edit-Product-Types-768x447.png 768w\" alt=\"FeedOps Product Feed Editor - product keyword research- Product Type\" width=\"1166\" height=\"678\" \/><\/p><p>To edit the columns, users simply select the products using the check boxes on the left hand side and select \u2018Edit\u2019. The screen below then launches:<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types.png\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2190px) 100vw, 2190px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types.png 2190w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types-300x192.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types-1024x654.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types-768x490.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types-1536x981.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/keywords-in-product-types-2048x1307.png 2048w\" alt=\"product keyword research\" width=\"2190\" height=\"1398\" \/><\/p><h4>(product keyword research) Selecting keywords by average monthly searchers.\u00a0<\/h4><p>From here, users are able to select which Product Type level to edit. You are able to edit Product Type levels 1 through to 5, as well as having the option to search for \u201cKeyword Ideas\u201d, in bulk or for individual products.<br \/>In the above example, we are editing Product Type (3rd Level).<br \/>Clicking into the dropdown box, you also get the \u2018Keyword Ideas\u2019 box, as well as the \u2018Average Monthly Searches\u2019 metric, with another box indicating whether you have the keyword already added against the selected attribute.<br \/>This will also bring up the average monthly searches, in the highlighted red box. Users can also filter at country level, to drill down to the search volumes related to their active markets.<br \/>In this case above, \u2018Woollen Socks\u2019 would be the correct term to insert at 3rd category level, due to the higher search volume.<br \/>Simply select the search term and hit \u2018Save\u2019.<\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong>How conduct product keyword research in FeedOps<\/strong><\/h3><p>1. Go to Website &gt; Channel &gt; Products.<\/p><p>2. Go to Columns Selection &gt; and select any\/all Product Type 1, Product Type 2, Product Type 3, Product Type 4, Product Type 5 &amp; Focus\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Keyword attributes.<\/p><p>3. Select the products that you want to fetch keyword ideas for.<\/p><p>4. Click on \u201cEdit\u201d and open the selected attribute.<\/p><p>5. Select the country you want to target and then click \u201cFetch Keyword Ideas\u201d.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-467d9fd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"467d9fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c377ada elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c377ada\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Explain Product Keyword Research to a 5 Year Old!<\/h2><p>When people sell things on the internet, they have to tell other people about the things they&#8217;re selling, like what the thing is, how much it costs, and what it looks like. But sometimes, they need help figuring out what words to use to describe their things so that more people can find them.<\/p><p>That&#8217;s where something called &#8220;<b>product keyword research<\/b>&#8221; comes in. It&#8217;s like a special tool that helps them figure out the best words to use to describe their things. When they use the right words, more people can find their things and want to buy them!<\/p><p>So, product keyword research is like a super helpful tool that helps people who sell things on the internet find the right words to use so that more people can see their things and want to buy them.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Product Keyword Research is a vital part of any Google Pmax or Bing shopping campaign. Do you want to reach more customers and sell more products? Selecting the right keywords and making sure that they appear in your product data feed is your answer.\u00a0 Table of Contents Why product keyword research matters! Product Keyword research [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":1884,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-911","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Product keyword research is an essential part of any successful product launch. Are you optimizing your shopping feed too?\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Product keyword research is an essential part of any successful product launch. Are you optimizing your shopping feed too?\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-01-16T03:40:28+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-05-12T22:43:32+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Product-Keyword-Research-Target-Valuable-Keywords-In-Feeds-1.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2560\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1709\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\"},\"headline\":\"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-01-16T03:40:28+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-05-12T22:43:32+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\"},\"wordCount\":212,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Product-Keyword-Research-Target-Valuable-Keywords-In-Feeds-1.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\",\"name\":\"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Product-Keyword-Research-Target-Valuable-Keywords-In-Feeds-1.png\",\"datePublished\":\"2023-01-16T03:40:28+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-05-12T22:43:32+00:00\",\"description\":\"Product keyword research is an essential part of any successful product launch. Are you optimizing your shopping feed too?\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Product-Keyword-Research-Target-Valuable-Keywords-In-Feeds-1.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Product-Keyword-Research-Target-Valuable-Keywords-In-Feeds-1.png\",\"width\":2560,\"height\":1709,\"caption\":\"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-keyword-research\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"width\":899,\"height\":929,\"caption\":\"FeedOps\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\",\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/feedops\/\",\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@feedops\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\",\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"caption\":\"Frank Grasso\"},\"description\":\"I\u2019ve managed over $700 million in ad spend, contributing to billions in revenue. I say \\\"contributing\\\" because online success hinges on three key factors: a product people want, a price they\u2019re willing to pay, and timely delivery. The rest is about attention to detail. I'm not your typical digital advertising expert. My background is unconventional. I left school at 14 and worked as a mechanic until I was 33. In 2002, I leveraged my problem-solving skills to launch a $1 million Google Ads campaign for a travel client. This experience taught me how to optimize ad quality and campaign structure to reduce costs. Over time, I witnessed Google\u2019s evolution: from Sponsored Links to AdWords, then Shopping Ads, Smart Shopping, and finally PMax. As Google expanded its digital media dominance, I realized that my agency needed to adapt. That\u2019s when I shifted focus and sold my agency to start FeedOps. At FeedOps, my mission is to help eCommerce businesses sell more products, increase revenue, and reduce ad spend. We focus on relevance, the core of effective digital advertising. By ensuring your product data and ads are highly relevant to user intent, we help you spend less and gain more. Relevance drives everything from higher click-through rates to better conversion rates and lower costs. At FeedOps, we harness this principle to optimize your ads and product data, ensuring you achieve better returns on your advertising investments. My mission is to help advertisers scale their creativity and productivity, and to provide them with the best tools and solutions to reach their target audiences and achieve their goals. I am passionate about leveraging the latest technologies and trends to enhance the capabilities and performance of our software, and to deliver exceptional value and service to our clients. I am also committed to building and nurturing a talented and diverse team of digital marketers and software developers, who share my vision and values of excellence, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/author\/frank-grasso\/\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO Premium plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"Product Keyword Research, Target Valuable Keywords In Feeds","description":"Product keyword research is an essential part of any successful product launch. Are you optimizing your shopping feed too?","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","ma